摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"VS Code-style workspace keyword search for DeepSeek Harness: a Search tab in dsh-better-sidebar","id":"gh:1334154781","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-workspace-search","slug":"tsonglew/dsh-workspace-search","topics":["better-sidebar","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"VS Code-style workspace keyword search for DeepSeek Harness: a Search tab in dsh-better-sidebar"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-workspace-search"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"VS Code-style workspace keyword search for the DeepSeek Harness (dsh) web GUI,\nregistered as a **Sea"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"rch tab** inside\ndsh-better-sidebar."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"- Keyword search across the session workspace: file **names** and file\n**contents**, grouped per fil"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"e with line numbers\n- VS Code-style search rules: **files to include / files to exclude** glob\npatte"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"rns (comma-separated, supports `**`, `*`, `?`, `{a,b}`), regular\nexpression queries (`.*` toggle), a"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"nd case toggle (`Aa`)\n- Click a match to open the file in better-sidebar's built-in editor\n- VS Code"},{"id":"p4s5","text":" default excludes: hidden files, `.git`, `node_modules`, `dist`,\n`build`, `.next`, `target` etc. are"},{"id":"p4s6","text":" skipped; caps on files, matches, and\nline length are reported honestly as truncation"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"(Requires `dsh-better-sidebar` ≥ 0.4.0, which exposes `ctx.betterSidebar`.)"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"All fields optional (profile patch layer):"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Dual-face bundle. The host half registers a Connection RPC channel\n`/workspace-search` (loopback tru"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"st fence, same as the built-in `/api`).\nThe browser half registers a tab through `ctx.betterSidebar."},{"id":"p12s3","text":"registerTab`.\nSearch results open in the sidebar editor via `openTab({type: 'editor'})`."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
